# Scheduled tasks for the ctr Docker container, run under supervisord's
# [program:cron] (see docker/supervisord.conf). This is the container
# equivalent of setup_review_deadline_alert.sh / setup_weekly_reminder.sh,
# which set up systemd timers for the bare-metal deployment - there's no
# systemd inside this container, so cron fills the same role at the same
# schedule.
#
# `. /etc/container.env` sources the DB_*/REDIS_* variables docker-compose
# gave this container (dumped by docker/entrypoint.sh at startup) - cron
# jobs don't inherit them otherwise. Output goes to app/tmp/logs rather
# than /var/log so the www-data user cron runs these as can actually write
# to it (app/tmp is chowned www-data in the Dockerfile; /var/log is not).
#
# This file must end with a blank line - cron.d requires it.

0 7 * * *   www-data . /etc/container.env; cd /var/www/html && ./app/Console/cake review_deadline_alert >> /var/www/html/app/tmp/logs/review_deadline_alert.log 2>&1
0 6 * * 1   www-data . /etc/container.env; cd /var/www/html && ./app/Console/cake weekly_reviewer_reminder_task >> /var/www/html/app/tmp/logs/reviewer_weekly_reminder.log 2>&1

